CodeExplorer/wwwroot/
# Written by the TanStack Router plugin before anything else runs — `vp check`, `vp test`, `vp build`
# and the dev server all regenerate it, including the container build's `vp build` on a fresh copy.
# It ships @ts-nocheck and is already excluded from both lint configs (web/vite.config.ts), so it is
# an artifact like wwwroot and dist. A clone that has run nothing yet has no route tree: the first
# `vp` command writes it, and until then an editor reports main.tsx's import as unresolved.
web/src/routeTree.gen.ts
*.tsbuildinfo
.pnpm-store/
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
npm-debug.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
coverage/

